            <p>PopClip Tip: Hold Shift to Copy</p>

            <blockquote>
              <p>Here is a quick tip about something very useful that I don’t think many users know about.</p>

            <p><em>Whenever you use an action that replaces text, you can always hold Shift to make PopClip copy that text instead.</em></p>

            <p>This works for all actions and extensions including convert markdown to html extension. </p>
            </blockquote>

            <p><a href="https://forum.popclip.app/t/popclip-tip-hold-shift-to-copy/2719">Nick</a></p>
            ]]>
